│ treatment of moderate to severe AA. Subjects and methods  Thirty‐four patients with moderate to severe AA (eight     │
│ men, mean age 40 ± 13 years) were enrolled in a randomized, double‐blind, right‐to‐left, placebo‐controlled, 24‐week │
