│ sites treated with CF vs. 11% in the sites treated with PF. The RGS was 1.2 ± 1.6 in the CF‐treated sites and 0.4 ±  │
│ 0.8 in the PF‐treated sites (P = 0.001). A RGS of  2 (hair regrowth of more than 25%) was observed in 42% CF‐treated │
│ sites and in 13% of PF‐treated sites (P = 0.027). In seven subjects (20%) a RGS of 3 to 4 (hair regrowth of  50%)    │
