groups. Patients in group A (23 patients) were treated with oral prednisolone (200 mg once weekly, 5 40-mg tablets) and 
patients in group B (20 patients) were given placebo tablets on an identical schedule. The total study period was 6     
months, consisting of 3 months of active therapy followed by another 3 months of observation. RESULTS Significant hair  
regrowth was obtained in 8 patients in the prednisolone-treated group. Two of the responders experienced a relapse      
