corticosteroid formulation. In scalp psoriasis patients BVF has induced a significantly greater clinical improvement in 
comparison with corticosteroid lotions. No data are available to date regarding the efficacy and safety of BVF in       
mild-to-moderate alopecia areata (AA). STUDY AIM To evaluate the efficacy, tolerability and safety of BVF treatment in  
